Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): final Stage A hardenings before TUI live probe

Remove WhatsApp app default from ComputerUseSubstrate; require smoke-bind
before READY; uniform composition diagnostics; rename forced vs production
composition goldens.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
